-	
-		//**********************************************************
-	// Learn normal bleed-down rate
-	//
-	// Only learn while:
-	// 1. Bleed FB has a valid rate
-	// 2. A bleed valve is actually commanded open
-	//
-	// This prevents coast/settle pressure movement from
